How to obtain the excluded parts legally
----------------------------------------
The frontend bundle is served publicly by the site you are cloning. If you
choose to fetch it under whatever terms apply to you, place the assets in
`clone/assets/` and run `node clone/patch.mjs` to apply the NetraFlix control
patches. `patch.mjs` is idempotent and is original work licensed here.

The metadata backend (`server/`) requires NO third-party bundle at all — it is
a clean-room reimplementation against TMDB's and AniList's public APIs.

